     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Hello,<br>I have made a relatively major update to v0.72.0. There are several changes, which you may find at the <a href=\"https://github.com/cwatson/brainGraph/commit/78fbae32b6b92a6a99fe8f63e4f2f23dc2dd67ba?short_path=8312ad0#diff-8312ad0561ef661716b48d09478362f3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/cwatson/brainGraph/commit/78fbae32b6b92a6a99fe8f63e4f2f23dc2dd67ba?short_path%3D8312ad0%23diff-8312ad0561ef661716b48d09478362f3&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792488189519000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0BdjdQpBY3qGxsbxBPKu9o\">NEWS.md</a> file. One addition is the &#39;dosenbach160&#39; atlas, which is in use with the DPARSF software (Matlab-based).<br><br>Please let me know if there are any issues. The User Manual should be updated this week.<br><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Chris<br></div></div>\r\n"
    ]
   ]
  },
